  "contenu": {
    "_type": "localeRichText",
    "en": [
      {
        "_key": "t5u",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t5t",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Three villages in one"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t5w",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t5v",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Les Riceys brings together three former villages: Ricey-Bas, Ricey-Haut and Ricey-Haute-Rive. Once attached to three different bishoprics, they now form a single municipality."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t5y",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t5x",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "The largest vineyard in Champagne"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t63",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t5z",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "With more than 840 hectares of vines, Les Riceys is the most planted village in the whole of Champagne. Pinot noir reigns here, as everywhere in the "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t61",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t60"
            ],
            "text": "Côte des Bar"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t62",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t60",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/en/la-cote-des-bar/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t65",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t64",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Rosé des Riceys, a rarity"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t67",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t66",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Rosé des Riceys is a still wine, without bubbles, made exclusively from pinot noir. Recognised as an appellation d'origine contrôlée by a decree of 8 December 1947, it is harvested only within the village, on delimited plots. Around 350 hectares may produce it, but only a small part is used for it: it remains rare."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t69",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t68",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Champagne and Coteaux Champenois"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t6b",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t6a",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Alongside the rosé, the winemakers of Les Riceys produce champagne and Coteaux Champenois, the still wines of Champagne."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t6d",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t6c",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Discover this terroir"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t6o",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t6e",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "The best way to understand this terroir is to discover it with the people who farm it. Join one of "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t6g",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t6f"
            ],
            "text": "our tastings"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t6h",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", in Troyes or at your home, or discover "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t6j",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t6i"
            ],
            "text": "our selection"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t6k",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ". Are you a restaurant, wine shop or hotel? Discover "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t6m",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t6l"
            ],
            "text": "our trade offer"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t6n",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t6f",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/en/tasting-troyes/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t6i",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/en/winemakers/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t6l",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/en/champagne-for-hotels-restaurants-and-wine-shops/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      }
    ],
    "fr": [
      {
        "_key": "t4y",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t4x",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Trois villages en un"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t50",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t4z",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Les Riceys réunissent trois anciens bourgs : Ricey-Bas, Ricey-Haut et Ricey-Haute-Rive. Autrefois rattachés à trois évêchés différents, ils forment aujourd'hui une seule commune."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t52",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t51",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Le plus grand vignoble de Champagne"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t57",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t53",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Avec plus de 840 hectares de vignes, Les Riceys est la commune la plus plantée de toute la Champagne. Le pinot noir y règne, comme partout dans la "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t55",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t54"
            ],
            "text": "Côte des Bar"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t56",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t54",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/la-cote-des-bar/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t59",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t58",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Le Rosé des Riceys, une rareté"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t5b",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t5a",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Le Rosé des Riceys est un vin tranquille, sans bulles, issu exclusivement de pinot noir. Reconnu en appellation d'origine contrôlée par un décret du 8 décembre 1947, il ne se récolte que sur la commune, dans des parcelles délimitées. Environ 350 hectares peuvent le produire, mais seule une petite partie y est consacrée : il reste rare."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t5d",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t5c",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Champagne et coteaux champenois"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t5f",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t5e",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "À côté du rosé, les vignerons des Riceys produisent du champagne et des coteaux champenois, des vins tranquilles de Champagne."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t5h",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t5g",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Découvrir ce terroir"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t5s",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t5i",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Le meilleur moyen de comprendre ce terroir, c'est de le découvrir avec ceux qui le cultivent. Rejoignez l'une de "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t5k",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t5j"
            ],
            "text": "nos dégustations"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t5l",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", à Troyes ou chez vous, ou découvrez "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t5n",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t5m"
            ],
            "text": "notre sélection"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t5o",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ". Vous êtes restaurateur, caviste ou hôtelier ? Découvrez "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t5q",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t5p"
            ],
            "text": "notre offre pro"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t5r",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t5j",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/tasting-troyes/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t5m",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/vignerons/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t5p",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/champagne-hotel-restaurants-et-cavistes/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      }
    ],
    "it": [
      {
        "_key": "t7m",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t7l",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Tre villaggi in uno"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t7o",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t7n",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Les Riceys riunisce tre antichi borghi: Ricey-Bas, Ricey-Haut e Ricey-Haute-Rive. Un tempo legati a tre diversi vescovati, oggi formano un unico comune."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t7q",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t7p",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Il più grande vigneto della Champagne"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t7v",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t7r",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Con oltre 840 ettari di vigne, Les Riceys è il comune più vitato di tutta la Champagne. Il pinot noir vi regna, come in tutta la "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t7t",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t7s"
            ],
            "text": "Côte des Bar"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t7u",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t7s",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/it/la-cote-des-bar/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t7x",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t7w",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Il Rosé des Riceys, una rarità"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t7z",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t7y",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Il Rosé des Riceys è un vino fermo, senza bollicine, ottenuto esclusivamente da pinot noir. Riconosciuto come appellation d'origine contrôlée con un decreto dell'8 dicembre 1947, si vendemmia solo nel comune, su parcelle delimitate. Circa 350 ettari possono produrlo, ma solo una piccola parte vi è dedicata: resta raro."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t81",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t80",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Champagne e Coteaux Champenois"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t83",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t82",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Accanto al rosé, i vignaioli di Les Riceys producono champagne e Coteaux Champenois, i vini fermi della Champagne."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t85",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t84",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Scoprire questo terroir"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t8g",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t86",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Il modo migliore per capire questo terroir è scoprirlo con chi lo coltiva. Partecipate a una delle "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t88",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t87"
            ],
            "text": "nostre degustazioni"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t89",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", a Troyes o a casa vostra, oppure scoprite "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t8b",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t8a"
            ],
            "text": "la nostra selezione"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t8c",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ". Siete ristoratori, enotecari o albergatori? Scoprite "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t8e",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t8d"
            ],
            "text": "la nostra offerta per professionisti"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t8f",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t87",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/it/tasting-troyes/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t8a",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/it/vignaioli/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t8d",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/it/champagne-per-hotel-ristoranti-ed-enoteche/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      }
    ],
    "nl": [
      {
        "_key": "t6q",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t6p",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Drie dorpen in één"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t6s",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t6r",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Les Riceys verenigt drie vroegere dorpen: Ricey-Bas, Ricey-Haut en Ricey-Haute-Rive. Vroeger hoorden ze bij drie verschillende bisdommen; vandaag vormen ze één gemeente."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t6u",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t6t",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "De grootste wijngaard van de Champagne"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t6z",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t6v",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Met meer dan 840 hectare wijngaard is Les Riceys de meest beplante gemeente van de hele Champagne. Pinot noir is hier koning, zoals overal in de "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t6x",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t6w"
            ],
            "text": "Côte des Bar"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t6y",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t6w",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/nl/la-cote-des-bar/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t71",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t70",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Rosé des Riceys, een zeldzaamheid"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t73",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t72",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Rosé des Riceys is een stille wijn, zonder bubbels, uitsluitend van pinot noir. Erkend als appellation d'origine contrôlée bij decreet van 8 december 1947, wordt hij alleen in de gemeente geoogst, op afgebakende percelen. Zo'n 350 hectare mag hem voortbrengen, maar slechts een klein deel wordt ervoor gebruikt: hij blijft zeldzaam."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t75",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t74",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Champagne en Coteaux Champenois"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t77",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t76",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Naast de rosé maken de wijnmakers van Les Riceys champagne en Coteaux Champenois, de stille wijnen van de Champagne."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t79",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t78",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Dit terroir ontdekken"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t7k",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t7a",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "De beste manier om dit terroir te begrijpen, is het te ontdekken met wie het bewerkt. Kom naar een van "
          },
          {
